<title>SOUTH KOREA: S.Korea's SKC Ltd share offer 53 times subscribed.</title>
<headline>S.Korea's SKC Ltd share offer 53 times subscribed.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-06-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>An initial share offer by SKC Ltd, a unit of South Korea's Sunkyong Group, was 52.65 times subscribed, lead manager Dongsuh Securities said on Saturday.</p>
<p>SKC offered 300,000 new common shares at 22,000 won per share, against the face value of 5,000 won.</p>
<p>Payment is due by July 2 and the company's listing on the Seoul bourse is expected on July 18.</p>
</text>
